OL,3,GNEWSASoapbox challenge sees thousands
OL,4,Adescend on town
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of spectators watched
OL,7,Fhomemade carts hurtle round the streets
OL,8,Ffor a town's annual soapbox course.
OL,10,FThe Amazing Accrington Soapbox
OL,11,FChallenge saw a range of vehicles
OL,12,Fcompeting in the film-themed event.
OL,14,FTwenty-three teams took part in the
OL,15,Frace, over three quarters of a mile of
OL,16,Ftwists and turns.
OL,18,FThe Mission Improbable team won the
OL,19,Fcommunity group category, with their
OL,20,FThunderbirds-themed cart, and the
OL,21,Fbusiness group race was won by Baxenden
OL,22,FCar Breakers.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
